/P 1349 0 R
/T (A web service is a software system that offers data or functions to other programs over a network, using web technologies. A program sends a request, the service processes it, and the service sends back a response. No person needs to read a web page in the middle of this exchange.)
/E (A web service is a software system that offers data or functions to other programs over a network, using web technologies. A program sends a request, the service processes it, and the service sends back a response. No person needs to read a web page in the middle of this exchange.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
