/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1349 0 R
/T (A web service is the running system. Its API is the interface that other programs use to reach it. A useful comparison is a restaurant: the kitchen is the service, and the menu is the API. Customers do not enter the kitchen; they use the menu to order.)
/E (A web service is the running system. Its API is the interface that other programs use to reach it. A useful comparison is a restaurant: the kitchen is the service, and the menu is the API. Customers do not enter the kitchen; they use the menu to order.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
