/E (The term has a narrow and a broad meaning. In the original sense, "web services" meant services described with WSDL and exchanged with SOAP messages \(Chinnici et al., 2007\). Today the term is also used for any service reachable over HTTP, including REST APIs. In this document we use the broad meaning.)
