<<
/Title (Why POST for read-only analysis? The input is a large block of text that may contain job-related content, which does not belong in a URL \(URLs have length limits and can be recorded in logs\). POST allows a request body. These requests have no side effect on stored data, because the service is stateless. Express can therefore retry them safely, with a small retry limit and a timeout \(see B6\).)
/Dest [43 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6591 0 R
/Next 6639 0 R
>>
endobj
