/Title (Retries can fix temporary problems, but they can also cause damage. Microsoft's guidance for the Retry pattern is to retry only transient faults, to wait between attempts, to stop after a limited number of attempts, to log failures, and to consider whether the operation is idempotent. If it is not, a retry might execute it more than once \(Microsoft, n.d.-c\).)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
